msgstr "Czy otrzymałem certyfikat z każdego kursu lub programu"

#: enterprise/views.py:420
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"My permission applies only to data from courses or programs that are "
"sponsored by {enterprise_customer_name}, and not to data from any "
"{platform_name} courses or programs that I take on my own. I understand that"
" I may withdraw my permission only by fully unenrolling from any courses or "
"programs that are sponsored by {enterprise_customer_name}."
